  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-WMC 205.09 Requests for Findings and Conclusions. Any party may submit requests for findings of fact and conclusions of law by the close of the record, as established under Env-WMC 205.10.\n\nSource. #8031, eff 1-24-04",
